					<hr width="75%" align="left">
					<div class="xsmall"><a href="http://www.guildsay.com/guilds/view_character.php?id=1891">Kandu Windwolf</a></div><div class="xsmall"><a href="http://www.guildsay.com/guilds/view_character.php?id=2049">Nimblybo</a></div><div class="xsmall"><a href="http://www.guildsay.com/guilds/view_character.php?id=2170">Jeewiz</a></div>					
					<br>
