					<tr>
						<td width="100%" class="body" valign="top">
														Hey Mord! I had the same problem and wound up emailing someone in admin, but before it comes to that,try this: Go to his page ( Mordiken from the DF roster) and, in the &quot;Guild Status&quot; dropdown box, select &quot;Unguilded&quot; and hit the update button. Once unguilded, a new option should appear in the Options dialog box... and that would be to &quot;Add to Guild.&quot;  Select this option, select Noble Alliance as the guild and enter its guild password and you're all set! I am checking guildsay to verify our members and you should appear on our roster within 24 hours.						</td>
					</tr>
										<tr>
						<td class="body" align="left">
