					<hr width="75%" align="left">
					<div class="xsmall"><a href="http://www.guildsay.com/guilds/view_character.php?id=2175">Ferriciean Aetas</a></div><div class="xsmall"><a href="http://www.guildsay.com/guilds/view_character.php?id=2176">Dolere Necare</a></div><div class="xsmall"><a href="http://www.guildsay.com/guilds/view_character.php?id=2177">Sedyei</a></div><div class="xsmall"><a href="http://www.guildsay.com/guilds/view_character.php?id=2178">Relegare</a></div>					
					<br>
				</td>
				<td width="70%" class="body" valign="top">
					<table width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0">
					<tr>
						<td width="100%" class="body" valign="top">
														hiya mordiken!  we havent met, but im ferriciean the bard advisor.  my wife just recently started playing (Iilili) and is now a lvl 9 wizard.  As i have only just started playing a full caster (7 necro) i dont have much to offer her in the ways of knowledge with wizards.  i did notice this:  she kicks ass!  hehe  she can solo stuff that warriors her lvl can't!  is this normal?  or is she just special.  i don't see many wizards around.  i here they get frustrated usually and quit.  any ideas as to why?  hehe perhaps you could post a &quot;Guide to Wizardry&quot; soon.... ALSO... email it to noblealliance@yahoo.com as i am about to begin the long drawn out process of creating the guild page =D.  well i've gotta get back to work =(  see ya later hehe<br />
<br />
ferriciean aetas						</td>
