				<td width="70%" class="body" valign="top">
					<table width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0">
					<tr>
						<td width="100%" class="body" valign="top">
														Ferriciean,  Excellent idea,  as soon as I get my new computer, (hoprfully tomorrow, crosses fingers)  I will try to put something together.  Playing a wizard is sometimes frustrating, and if you don't have patience it can be discouraging.  Tell her to hang in there, IT IS WORTH IT.  Alot of players have VERY diffrent opinions about wizards, you will hear people call us taxi's and on and on and on, but the fact is no other class can dish out the short term damage like a wiz!!!  If played right wizards can solo monsters with no problem.  At that level I did alot of soloing,  eventuall she  will need to group up to get threw some hard levels.  Next time I am on (which hopefully will be alot more)  I will track her down and see how I can help her.  If you need anything send a tell or leave a post.  Is your wife in the guild?  I will work on a guide, I will try to geet something to you ASAP.  Good to hear from you.  Let it be know that I am here to HELP!  I will try to make up my lack of play time by helping out in other ways.  Hopefully I can just play more!!  See you all later, HAVE FUN!						</td>
